# DRAW-ORDER probe (populated re-review bug round).
# Two painter's-order failures in one scene:
#  (a) the stage canopy used to be sorted past the whole footprint
#      (anchor + 2*span - 1), so it painted OVER the thought bubbles
#      of peeps standing IN FRONT of (south of) the stage — the shot
#      showed no bubbles at all;
#  (b) a peep standing BEHIND (north of) the stage must lose to the
#      building: its head must not paint over the canopy.
# The roof extras now sort at the footprint's back edge and the front
# extras at its front edge, so (a) draws after the canopy and (b)
# draws before it.
#
# Pixel asserts are scatter-proof by construction: 36 front peeps
# (9 per front tile) blanket the canopy's inset, so pixel (655,366)
# is inside every one of their bubbles whatever the per-peep hash
# scatter; in the old code that pixel is the canopy inset color
# (213,86,236) because the canopy painted last. Pixel (616,318) is
# a fixed canopy pixel over the north peep's head: canopy purple
# (110,16,126) in both old and new code — a guard against a future
# "fix" that draws all peeps after buildings.
reset_game
set_spawn_enabled 0
set_sprites on
set_move_speed 0
spawn_agents 30 29 9 bathroom
spawn_agents 31 29 9 bathroom
spawn_agents 32 29 9 bathroom
spawn_agents 33 29 9 bathroom
spawn_agents 30 24 1 bathroom
wait_frames 2
set_need_timer bathroom 0.95
wait_frames 2
assert_urgent_bubble_count eq 37
assert_pixel 655 366 not 213 86 236 255
assert_pixel 616 318 is 110 16 126 255
screenshot draw_order_sprite
# Same bubble in primitive mode (text bubble, same white shell point).
set_sprites off
assert_sprites off
wait_frames 2
assert_pixel 655 366 not 213 86 236 255
screenshot draw_order_nosprite
set_sprites on
assert_sprites on
